{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01246",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 2.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "right then, come on in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.03,
      "end_seconds": 9.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.74,
      "end_seconds": 15.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.79,
      "end_seconds": 23.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "Alright, good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair. Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.38,
      "end_seconds": 27.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I've been dealing with night sweats."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.05,
      "end_seconds": 29.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.01,
      "end_seconds": 38.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "hm it was either the end of last month or earlier than that i couldn't tell you the date"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.24,
      "end_seconds": 49.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.32,
      "end_seconds": 57.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. Only changing the sheets, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.75,
      "end_seconds": 62.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Right, have you been losing weight without trying?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.61,
      "end_seconds": 66.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Yes, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.03,
      "end_seconds": 70.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Have you had difficulty swallowing, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.27,
      "end_seconds": 73.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No difficulty swallowing, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.66,
      "end_seconds": 79.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "and what about itching, coughing up blood or bone pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.36,
      "end_seconds": 86.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "I haven't had itching, coughing up blood or bone pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.16,
      "end_seconds": 92.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.82,
      "end_seconds": 96.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.64,
      "end_seconds": 105.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.49,
      "end_seconds": 109.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.5,
      "end_seconds": 116.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 117.18,
      "end_seconds": 122.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "She takes rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.57,
      "end_seconds": 127.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.61,
      "end_seconds": 133.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.97,
      "end_seconds": 139.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.16,
      "end_seconds": 148.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to trimethoprim, but I don't remember what reaction I had"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.1,
      "end_seconds": 154.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Okay, are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.96,
      "end_seconds": 159.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.25,
      "end_seconds": 162.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.17,
      "end_seconds": 165.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.92,
      "end_seconds": 179.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.31,
      "end_seconds": 193.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.53,
      "end_seconds": 212.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.6, pressure 115 over 76, oxygen saturation is 97 percent. And respiratory rate 15, pulse 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.95,
      "end_seconds": 216.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.01,
      "end_seconds": 224.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Okay, I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.37,
      "end_seconds": 230.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.83,
      "end_seconds": 233.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.6,
      "end_seconds": 256.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.1,
      "end_seconds": 275.7,
      "duration_seconds": 13.6,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Having listened and examined, this looks most like an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.51,
      "end_seconds": 279.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.31,
      "end_seconds": 289.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.42,
      "end_seconds": 325.78,
      "duration_seconds": 18.36,
      "text": "we should do a chest X-ray for cough and weight loss come back after the results are back so, can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.43,
      "end_seconds": 332.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.29,
      "end_seconds": 338.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.11,
      "end_seconds": 343.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}